_oc=Adp5Boay3VY2oXlM2g8EpqhgD95uuvzb9C1xDioIFuSG9Q0WXaBdMxOV_GH3DzZ577M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9j1YatEfOiXDc-m0wulGAHvCbOZb53wKU0-_NhHxdOw&oe=6AF9E44D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape cover-Be a Bro Update 1.png", "id": "2655574474874874", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/767772105_2655574478208207_9081221271502671144_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GNSnzjRWwD8Q7kNvwH3_8E8&_nc_oc=AdpnFFoL6DEkkN0ORNbsTNYOOwsEfaley7Vs6e-E429vrj64LABcQsLY6gnnaJaUsB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKNB4LMvHSYfpo9kdO_Xf55NK1kdxeJactb-vUXosGLA&oe=6AF9BF75"}, "display_name": "GRO", "keywords": ["Farming", "GAG", "Garden", "Game", "VR"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                    \nA gardening adventure. Halloween is here, and GRO's owners are at WAR!\n\n{1961694904718240}\n# 5 NEW SEEDS ARE HERE!\nGrow Spooky Mushroom, Spooky Beanstalk, Candy Corn, Mythic Mummy and Venus Fly Trap! Collect them all and build the spookiest garden in GRO!\n# UNCLORD VS OVERLORD!\nGRO's OG owner is back! Vote for Unclord or Overlord in the biggest election yet. Who will rule GRO?\n{1471323561438861}\n# TRICK OR TREAT!\nWhack monsters to earn BOO Bucks! Unlock exclusive Halloween rewards and discover spooky surprises across the map!\n\n# GIVEAWAYS AND LIVE EVENTS\nGive away rare seeds, trade with friends and join the wildest VR community! Win exclusive rewards in live events.\n{2021170175493065}\n# NEW HALLOWEEN SKINS\nDress up in spooky new skins! Unlock Halloween bundles, powerful plants and exclusive cosmetics.\n\nBecome a **GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro**\n", "short_description": "Plant, Harvest, GRO-w!\n\nA fantasy farming sandbox, where coz